OL,3,GNEWSAOwl and cat catches helping to map
OL,4,Asmall mammals
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife group is hoping analysising
OL,7,Fwhat owls and cats are catching or
OL,8,Feating will support efforts to map
OL,9,Fsmall mammals in a region.
OL,11,FThe Northumbria Mammal Group and the
OL,12,FMammal Society are working to gather
OL,13,Fdata on what small mammals are present
OL,14,Fbetween the rivers Tyne and Tees in the
OL,15,FNorth East.
OL,17,FThe project, called Searching for
OL,18,FShrews, stems from efforts to track the
OL,19,Fimpact of the greater white-toothed
OL,20,Fshrew, amid fears the non-native
OL,21,Fspecies' spread could lead to a
OL,22,Freduction in numbers of other wildlife.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
